 "description": "A token's past broadcasts\n\nThe broadcasts a token page has sent, newest first, with `total` for paging. Anyone gets the public record: sent, not limited to a holder group. The page's owner or a manager, signed in, also gets holder-group sends and unsent scheduled drafts. When the token id exists on more than one chain, `crownChain` picks the token; without it the answer can be another token's messages.",
